# Signing keystores & secret material — never commit these to the repo.
# The keystore lives ONLY in GitHub Actions secrets (ANDROID_KEYSTORE_BASE64 etc.)
# and your own secure backup (password manager).
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore-info.txt
